OL,3,GNEWSA'This is my last shot at finding
OL,4,Amissing brother'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has made a "last chance" appeal
OL,7,Fto find her brother who went missing 30
OL,8,Fyears ago.
OL,10,FMichael Hewerdine was 32 when he
OL,11,Fdisappeared from his home in
OL,12,FRuskington, Lincolnshire, in 1996. He
OL,13,Fis believed to have hitched a lift from
OL,14,Fsomeone unknown to his family before he
OL,15,Fwent missing.
OL,17,FLincolnshire Police launched a murder
OL,18,Finvestigation three years later and his
OL,19,Fsister, Madeline Judd, has been
OL,20,Fsearching for answers ever since.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
